ROW copyoff  CF: RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRWWWWWWWWW
ROW copyon   CF: RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRWRWRWRWWWRRRWWWRRR
ROW copyoff  ZB: RRRRRRRRRRRRRWRWWRWRW
ROW copyon   ZB: RRRRRRRRRRRRRWRWWRWRW
ROW effect   CF=[+R 9] ZB=[+R 0] KNOWN DIFFERENCE (D-VERIFYREAD): the CF-3300 reads back each of its 9 written sectors

PASS: what VERIFY ON adds to a write
